{
  "name": "10b · Error Handling Demo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 10b · Error Handling Demo\nThree ways to deal with failures:\n\n1. **Retry** – *Call Unreliable API* → Settings → *Retry On Fail* (3 tries, 2 s apart)\n2. **Error branch** – the same node has *On Error: Continue (using error output)*, so a failure goes down the red path to **Use Fallback Data** instead of stopping\n3. **Fail loudly** – set `failOnPurpose` to `true` in **Settings** and **Stop and Error** fails the run, which triggers your *Error Workflow* (10a)\n\nThe API URL always returns HTTP 500, so you will see the fallback path.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-80, -440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
              "name": "failOnPurpose",
              "value": false,
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://httpbin.org/status/500",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Call Unreliable API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 100],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102", "name": "source", "value": "api", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000103", "name": "data", "value": "={{ $json }}", "type": "object" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Use API Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [700, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104", "name": "source", "value": "fallback", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000105", "name": "data", "value": "={{ { note: 'cached default values' } }}", "type": "object" },
            { "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000106", "name": "apiError", "value": "={{ $json.error?.message ?? 'unknown error' }}", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Use Fallback Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [700, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000107",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.failOnPurpose }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Fail on Purpose?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [960, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "=Stopped on purpose (data source: {{ $json.source }}). This failure triggers the Error Workflow."
      },
      "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Stop and Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1200, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "10b00000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Continue Normally",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1200, 200]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Settings", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Call Unreliable API", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Call Unreliable API": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Use API Data", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Use Fallback Data", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Use API Data": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Fail on Purpose?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Use Fallback Data": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Fail on Purpose?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Fail on Purpose?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Stop and Error", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Continue Normally", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "tags": []
}
